l acuity, refraction, eye health assessment, and intraocular pressure measurement. The standard of care is identical, and the optometrist can detect conditions such as glaucoma, cataracts, macular degeneration, and diabetic eye disease just as effectively."}]]}],"$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38"]}]]}]}]
